e_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equals or exceeds the incoming attack roll, the attack deals half damage on a hit. You can then immediately move to any other square adjacent to your attacker and make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," against it. This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Lightsaber Form (",{"tag":"a","children":["Djem So"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Djem_So"},"):"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Djem So"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Djem_So"}]}," Talent, after successfully activating this Form Power, you gain one temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," which can only be used to activate the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Djem So"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Djem_So"}]}," talent. If this temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," is not used before the end of the encounter, it is lost.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to treat the attacker as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," for purposes of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
